    <Cell ss:StyleID="Cell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Open /shifts or /team-schedule. 2. Toggle between &quot;Weekly View&quot; and &quot;Monthly View&quot;. 3. Navigate weeks.</Data></Cell>
